  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\">X-RAY PLUS</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>EN</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>此 X 光材質包加入了 X 光功能，讓您可以穿透牆壁輕鬆定位礦物，您還能查看地牢、生成點、要塞等更多內容。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>此材質包相容於：</strong><br><strong>-Adabraniummod</strong><br><strong>-Allthemodium</strong><br><strong>-Appliedenergistics2</strong><br><strong>-Astromine</strong><br><strong>-Bno</strong><br><strong>-Decorative</strong><br><strong>-Dishes</strong><br><strong>-Enderitemod</strong><br><strong>-Endreborn</strong><br><strong>-Forestry</strong><br><strong>-Indrev</strong><br><strong>-Mechanized</strong><br><strong>-Mechanism</strong><br><strong>-Mysticalagriculture</strong><br><strong>-Pixelmon</strong><br><strong>-Quark</strong><br><strong>-Sandwichable</strong><br><strong>-Techreborn</strong><br><strong>-Thaumcraft</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>ES</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>此 X 光材質包加入了 X 光功能，讓您可以穿透牆壁輕鬆定位礦物，您還能查看地牢、生成點、要塞等更多內容。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>此材質包相容於：<br>-Adabraniummod<br>-Allthemodium<br>-Appliedenergistics2<br>-astromine<br>-Bno<br>-Decorative<br>-Dishes<br>-Enderitemod<br>-Endreborn<br>-Forestry<br>-Indrev<br>-Mechanized<br>-Mekanism<br>-Mysticalagriculture<br>-Pixelmon<br>-Quark<br>-Sandwichable<br>-Techreborn<br>-Thaumcraft</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者：@d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CD5oSJn.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支援我 ❤️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/